# The PCF8584 accesses of the DS20E console (PC264SRM.ROM V7.3-1) booting and running show fru
# and show config, recorded with ALPHABOX_RECORD=raw,i2c by srm_probe.sh (PLATFORM=ds20e) with
# the 24C02 acknowledging write data (write-protected) and from the fall of the eighth clock.
# The bus: erased 24C02s at 0x27, 0x4f and 0x60-0x67. Left out: a status (S1) read that repeats
# the S1 read just before it, which is the console polling an idle controller; S1 reads change
# nothing, so the replay sees the same answers. test/unit/i2c_test.cpp replays it.
